{
  "id": "ch3",
  "title": "THE VERDANT BIODOME",
  "objPage": "S2A0",
  "preset": "verdant",
  "notes": [
    "COHERENCE (2026-10-22): ch3 walks into the Verdant Biodome from outside in: a0 THE GLASS PERIMETER is the jungle edge at the lake (E2a0 0-1472 only), a1 THE HATCHERY is the greenhouse ruin under the broken glass dome (E6a0 944-1968 only: the dome frame with the sky through it, the pipe ribs, the lamp-hung rock beds), a2 THE NEST is the overgrown nest jungle inside (E6a1 512-1792 only, the mother's kind standing among the trunks). Each area walks back and forth through its one source strip (legs <= 512 px, leftward legs mirrored), so every join is a mirror join or a continuation; the place changes only at the fades.",
    "Palette: verdant on every slice (rock and timber rows hue +35, 15% toward #5c4, sky lightness 1.1) plus a greenhouse tint per area; the far layer of each area is its own source's (the lake and sky, the sky through the dome glass, the jungle canopy).",
    "Boss arena (3-6, GLASSBACK, the therizinosaur mother guarding her eggs): egg clutches in straw nests along the back of the lane (the E5a0 field boulders, lifted, their stone pens tinted eggshell and the grass around them dried to straw) and the bones of what came too close (the E5a0 triceratops skull, lifted); all behind the sprites.",
    "Section casts (CAMPAIGN §4.4 'cast', merged over the chapter pool): lighter A/BOMB/KNIFE variants where the ROM-affine HP budget of the chapter's waves exceeded ENEMIES §2.6 by more than 15% (tests/campaign.cjs (8)); ratio now 1.139."
  ],
